ForcedTransfer_Captable_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not the company Governor nor the Safe nor Exits
│   └── it should revert with OnlyBoard
├── when the class does not exist
│   └── it should revert with UnknownClass
├── when the reason is zero
│   └── it should revert with ZeroReason
├── when the amount would move locked shares
│   ├── given the caller is the company Governor
│   │   └── it should revert with SharesLocked
│   └── given the caller is the Safe with the holder's consent
│       └── it should revert with SharesLocked
├── when the caller is the Safe or Exits
│   ├── when the holder recorded no consent for these exact terms
│   │   └── it should revert with ConsentMissing
│   ├── when the consent was already used
│   │   └── it should revert with ConsentMissing
│   └── when the holder consented to these exact terms
│       ├── it should use up the consent
│       ├── it should move the shares without checking the transfer rule
│       ├── it should move the votes with them
│       └── it should emit ForcedTransfer with the reason
└── when the caller is the company Governor after a passed vote
    ├── it should move the unlocked shares without the holder's consent
    ├── it should move the shares without checking the transfer rule
    ├── it should move the votes with them
    └── it should emit ForcedTransfer with the reason
